= BITwiki computational scope review =

This register makes existing questions visible under [[BITwiki:Computational scope]]. It does not treat a valid source citation, a formal model, the ability to digitize measurements or an unrelated <code>Related to</code> edge as proof that a concept belongs in BITwiki.

'''All entries below are pending K01 editorial review.''' A listing is not a verdict that the subject is invalid or that its article must be deleted. Review can retain an intrinsically informational treatment, reframe around a genuine computational or measurement method, move generic context into another article, or defer publication. Preserve source and revision lineage.

